# Response headers, read by Cloudflare Workers static assets (ADR-004).
# The Content-Security-Policy lives in index.html (meta tag, injected by the production build) so
# it applies to the page only: as a header it would also apply to a service worker (ADR-002).
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
